FlexInfer
=========

This repository contains the FlexInfer research artifact.

FlexInfer includes code derived from the llama.cpp project and its associated
components, including ggml and gguf-py. Those components are distributed under
MIT-style license terms. Retain the upstream copyright and permission notices
when redistributing source or binary artifacts.

Relevant upstream components in this repository include:

- `ggml/`
- `gguf-py/`
- `src/`, `include/`, `common/`, and `examples/` code originating from the
  llama.cpp ecosystem
- additional embedded third-party source files that retain their own notices,
  including `common/json.hpp`, `common/stb_image.h`,
  `examples/server/httplib.h`, and `ggml/src/ggml-sycl/`

See `LICENSE`, `gguf-py/LICENSE`, and source-file notices where present. Model
weights are not included in this repository.
